        "name": "explain_rule",
        "description": "Get full details for a specific VAST validation rule: description, spec reference, severity, what triggers it, and how to fix it. Use rule IDs from list_rules. This is the primary tool for understanding and fixing VAST issues flagged by validate_vast.",
