        "description": "AdCP content-standards specialism. Lists content governance standards. When called with an 'account' object, returns buyer-defined standards stored for that brand. Without an account, returns the built-in catalog of VAST-relevant standards. Supports cursor-based pagination via the 'pagination' object. Requires Bearer authentication: Authorization: Bearer <api_key>.",
